{"about_the_game":"RetroMania Wrestling is a &quot;pick-up-and-play&quot; wrestling game with beautiful 2D sprites, incredible backgrounds, and fast-paced arcade-style gameplay.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Featuring the National Wrestling Alliance and House of Hardcore!<br></li><li> Three distinct game modes: Story, 10 Pounds of Gold, and Retro Rumble!<br></li><li> 17 licensed, playable wrestlers (with more to come!)<br></li><li> 20 arenas to battle it out in!<br></li><li> 2-8 player local multiplayer!<br></li><li> Beautiful pixel art with over 1,000 frames of animation!<br></li><li> Ring entrances complete with nameplates and entrance music!<br></li><li> Strategic gameplay that is easy to pick up!<br></li><li> Crowd chants that react to the action on screen!<br></li><li> Commentary by Ian Riccaboni and Colt Cabana!<br></li><li> Several match types, including:<br>\u2022 1-on-1<br>\u2022 Tag Team (up to 8)<br>\u2022 Best of Three Falls<br>\u2022 Cage Matches (with different cage styles)<br>\u2022 Battle Royals</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"3b8533b797cedaf255defbdbca91071f854cf6f4.jpg","localized_name":"Big Debut!","name":"Big Debut!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1252300/3b8533b797cedaf255defbdbca91071f854cf6f4.jpg"},{"icon":"4471b120586211aa2cfbd1b138fb6c92b2ab71da.jpg","localized_name":"I Hope The Ref Didn't See That","name":"I Hope The Ref Didn't See That","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1252300/4471b120586211aa2cfbd1b138fb6c92b2ab71da.jpg"},{"icon":"8fa64d3d9389a24fe37b21fa8becd098e78d0906.jpg","localized_name":"I'm Just a Spectator","name":"I'm Just a Spectator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1252300/8fa64d3d9389a24fe37b21fa8becd098e78d0906.jpg"},{"icon":"669da8fe03d87efb2229e61f6da10e7e0f296e7f.jpg","localized_name":"Can't win 'em All","name":"Can't win 'em All","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.